          "readable": true,
          "readDisplay": "gameDisplay",
          "addToNotes": false,
          "text": "Maintenance log.\n\nThe printer's admin page still takes the account it came with. The manual is in the supply cupboard.\n\nThe storage machines: one of them is on an old build and the other keeps a share open by mistake. The wall switch by the lobby desk turns the open share off. The back office desk machine can be reached without its password if you have the right note for it.\n\nThe notes for these are spread about: the cabinet by the door, the supply drawer, and Ian.",
