          "readable": true,
          "readDisplay": "gameDisplay",
          "addToNotes": false,
          "text": "Ops access test. Take the drop box and plug it into a port. Sweep the office network, scan a machine, check its services and confirm what you find. The field notes you gather can be used on a confirmed finding. The supply room is to the west, the comms room north and the back office east.",
